ur Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="find-your-nearest-evri-parcel-locker" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0 feature-banner--mb-0" index="8" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Find your nearest Evri parcel Locker</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When you book online or with our app, you can choose which Locker or ParcelShop to use.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find your nearest parcel drop off and collection points with our ParcelShop and Locker Finder.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find your nearest locker" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshopa177?lockers=true" data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find your nearest locker<!--]--></span></a></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_53618a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side-profile view of a customer sitting on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="become-an-evri-locker-host" class="section-wrapper" index="9" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage18333.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman using terminal on parcel locker while holding cardboard box" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Become an Evri Locker host</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Looking to host an Evri Locker instead? Hosting an Evri Locker is an easy and hassle free way of generating income for your business. If you&#39;re interested in maximising your on-site space and would like to host an Evri Locker for your local area find out more on our Become an Evri Locker page.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Host an Evri Locker" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/host-a-locker" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Host an Evri Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><div id="parcel-locker-faqs" class="accordion accordion--brand-03" index="10" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h4 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>Parcel Locker FAQs</h4><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canigetmyparceldeliveredtoalocker-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re ordering from a retailer, you might be able to have your parcel delivered to a Locker, just select a convenient Locker on the retailer’s location finder when checking out. If you’re sending a parcel, you can also drop-off your parcel at a locker ready for one of our couriers to collect and deliver to the recipient we can’t deliver it to a parcel (but you can drop it off on one, ready to send). If you’ve arranged a home delivery and won’t be in, you may be able to divert you parcel to a Locker. Simply enter your tracking number on the website’s <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->tracking page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or on the Evri app and select ‘change delivery’ to choose where you’d like the parcel diverting to. If you’re not going to be in for your delivery you can divert your parcel to a neighbour or safe place.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="mybarcodeisntscanning-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-mybarcodeisntscanning" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-mybarcodeisntscanning" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="mybarcodeisntscanning-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="mybarcodeisntscanning-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>My barcode isn&#39;t scanning</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-mybarcodeisntscanning" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-mybarcodeisntscanning" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="mybarcodeisntscanning-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your barcode won’t scan, you can manually enter the 16-digit barcode at the terminal. If you’re still having issues, just select “help” on the terminal to find out what to do next.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>The Locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="thelockeristoosmallformyparcelwhatcanido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The first Locker door that will open will always be the smallest available. If you need a bigger Locker box, press “change box size” on the terminal and select the Locker most appropriate for your parcel. It’s really important that you measure your parcel correctly as there are size limits: max width 39cm, length 62cm, depth 57cm. If your parcel is too big for a Locker, take it to a ParcelShop, where the size limits are more flexible. Alternatively, arrange a courier collection from your home or workplace via our website or app.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>I&#39;m having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="imhavingtroublewiththelockerwhatcanido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re having any issues while you&#39;re at a Locker, don’t worry – technical support is available. Our Lockers are serviced by partner companies who maintain the Lockers and ensure you can access your parcels. You don&#39;t need to look any further than the Locker itself to call for assistance. Simply select “help” on the terminal to find out what to do next.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHATBOT_URL:"https://chat-loader.smartagent.app/loader/main.js",FEATURE_SWITCH_URL:"https://www.evri.com/feature-switches/feature-switches.json",FINDER_URL:"https://location-finder.evri.com",BASKET_API_KEY:"4GuiGkQaE92687ICJtKNRd01hc4JBKUG",BULK_API_KEY:"WtuYb1yZMIGwLJzEm0yUzhLzPGuKS632",EVRI_API_KEY:"0DExZiK9in2ihGce7cDPrnpQ4s4nIpWG",HELP_API_KEY:"IfhFrxnv1JmbNW2tBA9hnRvG1o1vnsx2",SEND_API_KEY:"fHbmtsuSHrBH5gaC6m2QF9QG3YAycmgN",TRACK_NON_ROTATING_API_KEY:"MgMPMhWhXxSp7xIoYUVnWDklTl7EXAgG",GLOBAL_CSS_URI:"https://resources.hermescloud.co.uk/global/",ROUTER_BASE:"/",ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-user-account-api/v1/",BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/business-account-enquiry-api/v1/",CLIENTS_JSON:"https://www.evri.com/clients/clients.js",CUSTOMER_ORDER_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/customer-order-api/v1/",RETAILERS_ENDPOINT:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/enterprise-returns-api/v1/retailers",TRACKING_ENDPOINT:"https://tracking.platform-apis.evri.com/v1/",CUSTOMER_TRACKING_API:"https://ap