 | Collect Parcels | Evri","Use Evri parcel Lockers to send, collect and return your parcels quickly and easily. Find out how to use Lockers for all your parcel needs.","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzNhIAACsA3CGA","subpath1",[],"en-gb","parcelshops","2022-02-25T15:18:17+0000","Document","5e06f393-d349-4103-af08-1a503c4bc092",false,{"link_type":18},[23,58,83,152,183,216,244,310,340,363,384],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":28,"id":56,"slice_type":57,"slice_label":29},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{},{"theme":29,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderCtaText":36,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":37,"secondaryCtaText":29,"secondaryCtaLabel":29,"secondaryCtaUrl":41,"PageHeaderImage":43,"heroImage":54,"videoContent":55,"showPremiumLogo":29},null,"Send, return and collect with Evri parcel Lockers",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35},"paragraph","Use our parcel Lockers 24\u002F7 to send, collect and return",[],"Find a Locker",{"link_type":38,"key":39,"url":40},"Web","142a7b30-736f-463e-9dff-7b118a62ca82","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?lockers=true",{"link_type":42},"Any",{"dimensions":44,"alt":47,"copyright":29,"url":48,"id":49,"edit":50},{"width":45,"height":46},300,46,"Lockers","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F84eb2db0-e547-4c81-8566-1850c6e8706a_lockers.svg","YhYpMBIAACoA0QBs",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$df4349c5-6581-43f7-87e0-1815ad68f575","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":59,"primary":61,"id":81,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":29},[60],{},{"CardImage":62,"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":72,"CardText":73,"ButtonText":78,"ButtonUrl":79,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":63,"alt":66,"copyright":29,"url":67,"id":68,"edit":69},{"width":64,"height":65},1000,667,"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"transparent","none","What are parcel Lockers?",[74],{"type":33,"text":75,"spans":76,"direction":77},"Our automated parcel Lockers are a quick, easy and convenient way to send, collect and return parcels. We have a vast network of Lockers located across the UK, each one available 24\u002F7, outside local shops and supermarkets.",[],"ltr","Find your nearest locker",{"link_type":38,"key":80,"url":40},"3376f7f2-921d-4420-8a4b-c2c818322fcf","card$977e57fc-5266-494d-9ca6-005766c0b815","card",{"variation":84,"version":25,"items":85,"primary":147,"id":150,"slice_type":151,"slice_label":29},"listComponent",[86,99,111,123,135],{"title":87,"content":88,"icon":92},"They’re open all the time",[89],{"type":33,"text":90,"spans":91},"24 hours a day, 7 days a week, ready when you are",[],{"dimensions":93,"alt":95,"copyright":29,"url":96,"id":97,"edit":98},{"width":94,"height":94},40,"Calender icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd07cc46f-b0cc-4157-a458-56979ba382e7_calendar.svg","Yh96FxIAAC4A-Zsf",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":100,"content":101,"icon":105},"Secure",[102],{"type":33,"text":103,"spans":104},"CCTV coverage and unique parcel codes give you peace of mind",[],{"dimensions":106,"alt":107,"copyright":29,"url":108,"id":109,"edit":110},{"width":94,"height":94},"Padlock icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F697a50eb-bb26-4e9d-b94e-cdba8778882b_padlock.svg","Yh96FxIAAC0A-ZsO",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":112,"content":113,"icon":117},"Send a range of parcel sizes",[114],{"type":33,"text":115,"spans":116},"Our largest Locker measures 62cm x 57cm x 39cm. If your parcel is too big for a Locker, take it to a ParcelShop, where the size limits are larger",[],{"dimensions":118,"alt":119,"copyright":29,"url":120,"id":121,"edit":122},{"width":94,"height":94},"Strapped boxes icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":124,"content":125,"icon":129},"Full tracking",[126],{"type":33,"text":127,"spans":128},"Whether you’re picking up or dropping off, we’ll track your parcel every step of it’s journey",[],{"dimensions":130,"alt":131,"copyright":29,"url":132,"id":133,"edit":134},{"width":94,"height":94},"Track location icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8b145688-a43b-4d6e-b22c-b7b556cc29a2_track.svg","Yh96FRIAACgA-Zrj",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":136,"content":137,"icon":141},"Divert to a Locker",[138],{"type":33,"text":139,"spans":140},"With many retailers, you can divert parcels to a Locker on your courier’s route. The only exceptions are if a signature is required or if a retailer requires us to deliver it to your address",[],{"dimensions":142,"alt":143,"copyright":29,"url":144,"id":145,"edit":146},{"width":94,"height":94},"Vehicle parts icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F60c6b591-52a0-4ad9-9c4c-d975eaa3d443_vehicle+parts.svg","Yh96FRIAACwA-Zrn",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"theme":29,"title":148,"description":149},"Why use Lockers?","There are loads of reasons to use a Locker to send your next parcel:","list_block$a2604711-8611-48fe-ad4a-a1784bbfc3aa","list_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":153,"primary":155,"id":181,"slice_type":182,"slice_label":29},[154],{},{"Image":156},{"dimensions":157,"alt":160,"copyright":29,"url":161,"id":162,"edit":163,"tablet":165,"mobile":172},{"width":158,"height":159},1200,280,"A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded hi-vis vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels.","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2943%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt",{"x":51,"y":164,"zoom":52,"background":70},2943,{"dimensions":166,"alt":160,"copyright":29,"url":169,"id":162,"edit":170},{"width":167,"height":168},704,240,"lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2671%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":51,"y":171,"zoom":52,"background":70},2671,{"dimensions":173,"alt":160,"copyright":29,"url":176,"id":162,"edit":177},{"width":174,"height":175},343,160,"lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_8JbqstJ9-iMt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9442.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=995%2C2357%2C6660%2C3107&w=343&h=160",{"x":178,"y":179,"zoom":180,"background":70},995,2357,1.23,"photo_block$4bd226b4-0606-4d60-a04e-6ddd5d068a7e","photo_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":184,"primary":212,"id":215,"slice_type":151,"slice_label":29},[185,191,196,204],{"title":186,"content":187,"isNumbered":188,"icon":189,"image":190},"Book online or with our app",[],true,{},{},{"title":192,"content":193,"isNumbered":188,"icon":194,"image":195},"Choose a Locker location",[],{},{},{"title":197,"content":198,"isNumbered":188,"icon":202,"image":203},"Scan the barcode on your shipping label",[199],{"type":33,"text":200,"spans":201},"And a door will automatically open. If you need a bigger Locker, click ‘too small’ on the screen and we’ll open the door on the biggest compartment, if it’s available",[],{},{},{"title":205,"content":206,"isNumbered":188,"icon":210,"image":211},"Put your parcel in, close the door, and that’s it!",[207],{"type":33,"text":208,"spans":209},"One of our couriers will collect your parcel and take it to one of our depots, ready for delivery",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":213,"description":214,"showPaddingTop":20},"How to send and\u002For return parcels via Lockers","It’s easy to use a Locker. At the terminal, scan the barcode on your shipping label or manually enter the 16-digit number. A door will automatically open. Place your parcel in the compartment, close the door and we’ll do the rest! Drop off by 12pm for same-day collection.","list_block$b9676a0d-416e-4e1c-b9fb-f1106ee7d589",{"variation":217,"version":25,"items":218,"primary":220,"id":243,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":29},"cardNoImageWithCta",[219],{},{"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":221,"CardText":222,"ButtonText":240,"ButtonUrl":241,"IsEco":20},"How to pick up parcels from Lockers",[223,226,229],{"type":33,"text":224,"spans":225},"Lots of retailers offer parcel Locker collection – just select it as a delivery option when you check out.",[],{"type":33,"text":227,"spans":228},"When your parcel arrives, you can collect it at any time over the next 3 days. We’ll send you a code to enter at the Locker, which will unlock the door to your parcel – it’s that simple!",[],{"type":33,"text":230,"spans":231},"With selected retailers, you can also divert a parcel to a Locker on your courier’s route – amend your delivery on our tracking page. Deliveries requiring proof of delivery can't be diverted, and some retailers don't permit parcel diversions.",[232,236],{"start":233,"end":234,"type":235},92,132,"strong",{"start":233,"end":234,"type":237,"data":238},"hyperlink",{"link_type":38,"url":239},"lockers.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","Divert to a locker",{"link_type":38,"key":242,"url":239},"7a3fca44-edd5-4cd2-9866-80cda99655fb","card$00f04164-8bc9-4b29-9c39-a34d5cb8f655",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":245,"primary":306,"id":309,"slice_type":151,"slice_label":29},[246,256,266,276,286,296],{"title":247,"content":248,"isNumbered":20,"icon":249,"image":255},"Book your parcel online or via our app and select your preferred Locker.",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":251,"copyright":29,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":94,"height":94},"Laptop icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"title":257,"content":258,"isNumbered":20,"icon":259,"image":265},"When you complete your order you’ll receive a QR code.",[],{"dimensions":260,"alt":261,"copyright":29,"url":262,"id":263,"edit":264},{"width":94,"height":94},"Phone icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"title":267,"content":268,"isNumbered":20,"icon":269,"image":275},"Scan the QR code at the Locker terminal to print your label there and then!",[],{"dimensions":270,"alt":271,"copyright":29,"url":272,"id":273,"edit":274},{"width":94,"height":94},"Printer icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"title":277,"content":278,"isNumbered":20,"icon":279,"image":285},"Attach the label to your parcel.",[],{"dimensions":280,"alt":281,"copyright":29,"url":282,"id":283,"edit":284},{"width":94,"height":94},"Icon of a parcel","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"title":287,"content":288,"isNumbered":20,"icon":289,"image":295},"Scan your barcode or manually enter the 16-digit barcode number to open a door.",[],{"dimensions":290,"alt":291,"copyright":29,"url":292,"id":293,"edit":294},{"width":94,"height":94},"Locker search icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9cc39c12-901c-49d8-902a-15b6d639b973_locker+-+search.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-ZsG",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"title":297,"content":298,"isNumbered":20,"icon":299,"image":305},"Place the parcel inside, close the door and we’ll do the rest!",[],{"dimensions":300,"alt":301,"copyright":29,"url":302,"id":303,"edit":304},{"width":94,"height":94},"Locker icon","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F27883279-ce7e-438b-9385-7cc38a072198_locker.svg","Yh96FxIAACgA-ZsL",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{},{"theme":29,"title":307,"description":308,"showPaddingTop":20},"Print your parcel labels at a Locker","No printer? No problem! You can quickly and easily print your parcel labels for FREE at an Evri Locker. Here’s how:","list_block$4295a733-f9ee-4bc3-899a-eeb9864353f7",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":311,"primary":313,"id":339,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":29},[312],{},{"CardImage":314,"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":321,"CardText":322,"ButtonText":335,"ButtonUrl":336,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":315,"alt":316,"copyright":29,"url":317,"id":318,"edit":319},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":51,"y":320,"zoom":52,"background":70},9,"Next Day and Standard delivery",[323,329],{"type":33,"text":324,"spans":325,"direction":77},"If you’re sending a parcel, you can choose between Next Day and Standard delivery for many Lockers (some might be Standard only). If Next Day is available, please drop it off by 12pm. ",[326],{"start":327,"end":328,"type":235},178,182,{"type":33,"text":330,"spans":331,"direction":77},"Make sure you only put 1 parcel in each compartment. Separate parcels need to be booked separately, with their own labels and compartments.",[332],{"start":333,"end":334,"type":235},23,51,"Send a parcel",{"link_type":38,"key":337,"url":338},"9219c215-f0db-445e-a3dd-824925593be3","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend","card$427258bb-da1e-41d6-86f6-0a5c273cfbbf",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":341,"primary":343,"id":361,"slice_type":362,"slice_label":29},[342],{},{"title":344,"bodyText":345,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":188,"NoMarginBottom":188,"hasButton":188,"buttonText":78,"buttonLink":352,"image":355},"Find your nearest Evri parcel Locker",[346,349],{"type":33,"text":347,"spans":348},"When you book online or with our app, you can choose which Locker or ParcelShop to use.",[],{"type":33,"text":350,"spans":351},"Find your nearest parcel drop off and collection points with our ParcelShop and Locker Finder.",[],{"link_type":38,"key":353,"url":354},"0b2b103b-7c92-4251-955b-5e0e654aab4a","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?lockers=true",{"dimensions":356,"alt":357,"copyright":29,"url":358,"id":359,"edit":360},{"width":64,"height":65},"A side-profile view of a customer sitting on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen.","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":70},"feature_banner$faa13d3b-3f73-4496-a23b-039da225888c","feature_banner",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":364,"primary":366,"id":383,"slice_type":82,"slice_label":29},[365],{},{"CardImage":367,"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":375,"CardText":376,"ButtonText":380,"ButtonUrl":381,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":368,"alt":370,"copyright":29,"url":371,"id":372,"edit":373},{"width":64,"height":369},665,"Woman using terminal on parcel locker while holding cardboard box","lockers.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F37e4506e-49f5-44f8-9006-d1db89f71b10_lockerimage1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C4%2C5000%2C3325&w=1000&h=665","Yh4IoRIAACgA8w_Y",{"x":51,"y":374,"zoom":52,"background":70},4,"Become an Evri Locker host",[377],{"type":33,"text":378,"spans":379,"direction":77},"Looking to host an Evri Locker instead? Hosting an Evri Locker is an easy and hassle free way of generating income for your business. If you're interested in maximising your on-site space and would like to host an Evri Locker for your local area find out more on our Become an Evri Locker page.",[],"Host an Evri Locker",{"link_type":38,"key":337,"url":382},"lockers.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fhost-a-locker","card$235aa385-92e9-4889-8787-0bb3bdd9c1bd",{"variation":385,"version":25,"items":386,"primary":416,"id":421,"slice_type":422,"slice_label":29},"default",[387,398,404,410],{"rowTitle":388,"rowBody":389,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"Can I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?",[390],{"type":33,"text":391,"spans":392},"If you’re ordering from a retailer, you might be able to have your parcel delivered to a Locker, just select a convenient Locker on the retailer’s location finder when checking out. If you’re sending a parcel, you can also drop-off your parcel at a locker ready for one of our couriers to collect and deliver to the recipient we can’t deliver it to a parcel (but you can drop it off on one, ready to send). If you’ve arranged a home delivery and won’t be in, you may be able to divert you parcel to a Locker. Simply enter your tracking number on the website’s tracking page or on the Evri app and select ‘change delivery’ to choose where you’d like the parcel diverting to. If you’re not going to be in for your delivery you can divert your parcel to a neighbour or safe place.",[393,396],{"start":394,"end":395,"type":235},560,573,{"start":394,"end":395,"type":237,"data":397},{"link_type":38,"url":239},{"rowTitle":399,"rowBody":400,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"My barcode isn't scanning",[401],{"type":33,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":77},"If your barcode won’t scan, you can manually enter the 16-digit barcode at the terminal. If you’re still having issues, just select “help” on the terminal to find out what to do next.",[],{"rowTitle":405,"rowBody":406,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"The Locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?",[407],{"type":33,"text":408,"spans":409,"direction":77},"The first Locker door that will open will always be the smallest available. If you need a bigger Locker box, press “change box size” on the terminal and select the Locker most appropriate for your parcel. It’s really important that you measure your parcel correctly as there are size limits: max width 39cm, length 62cm, depth 57cm. If your parcel is too big for a Locker, take it to a ParcelShop, where the size limits are more flexible. Alternatively, arrange a courier collection from your home or workplace via our website or app.",[],{"rowTitle":411,"rowBody":412,"rowDataGtmTrack":29},"I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",[413],{"type":33,"text":414,"spans":415,"direction":77},"If you’re having any issues while you're at a Locker, don’t worry – technical support is available. Our Lockers are serviced by partner companies who maintain the Lockers and ensure you can access your parcels. You don't need to look any further than the Locker itself to call for assistance. Simply select “help” on the terminal to find out what to do next.",[],{"title":417,"titleSize":418,"subtitle":29,"backgroundColor":419,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":29,"buttonLink":420,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29},"Parcel Locker FAQs","h4","brand-03",{"link_type":42},"accordion$6a0e3ab5-1e26-40b5-ad7f-b7aa2a2ea652","accordion",[23,58,83,152,183,216,244,310,340,363,384],["Reactive",425],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":426,"$sclients":492,"$sglobal-basket-count":29},{"abtasty":427,"accessibe":430,"appPromoBanner":433,"autoDivertUpdates":436,"awin":439,"bulkInternational":442,"bulkSendEnabled":445,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":448,"enableBasketCount":451,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":454,"euCustomsDuty":457,"groovyAdvert":460,"newInternationalSendFlow":463,"newinternationalpages":470,"oohPr